rlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639230/extras/47e7c5c5175d40ba0fbb0434df292ae5.poster.avif?t=1755249863\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639230/extras/47e7c5c5175d40ba0fbb0434df292ae5.webm?t=1755249863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639230/extras/47e7c5c5175d40ba0fbb0434df292ae5.mp4?t=1755249863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorful Underground</strong> – Explore a vibrant world beneath your feet with surprises at every depth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rewarding Progression</strong> – Sell ore, upgrade equipment, and watch your digging skills improve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragon Collection</strong> – Build a unique dragon sanctuary in your yard with each new discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Mysteries</strong> – Some secrets are buried deeper than others, waiting for the most determined diggers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing Experience</strong> – Get busy digging at your own pace in this charming underground adventure.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A relaxing digging simulator where you explore colorful underground worlds. Dig deeper, find valuable ores, upgrade your equipment, and collect rare dragons. The deeper you go, the more treasures and mysteries you'll discover.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3639230/afa67ee294b2f2aeac6ada43f7bfd2acd21245d5/header.jpg?t=1755249863", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st